  "notes": [
    "Real 2019 photograph of a TRS-80 Model I running Level II BASIC. Not a period capture and not an emulator.",
    "Screen is a short session after power-up, not a clean boot screen: power-up text, then a typed ?MEM command, its result 31956, READY and the cursor. The extra lines are not documented power-up text (RQ-6).",
    "Release blocked pending R14 rights review (RQ-1, RQ-2). Other review questions RQ-3 to RQ-6 are in qa.md.",
    "state.json is live workflow state and is excluded from the output inventory.",
    "Release approved 2026-09-15 by the producer under Devin's delegation (rights: Devin's standing R14 ruling). TRS-80 typed ?MEM session; acceptable for the BASIC-prompt montage. GPS EXIF stays in the byte-exact original only."
